{
  "schema": "s-protocol-site/photos@1",
  "about": "Processing manifest for scripts/images/build-images.mjs: the 17 owner-approved photos, where each one appears, and how it is cropped. Crops are fractions of the full frame (rect = [x0, y0, x1, y1]; focal = the point kept in view at the slot aspect), so they work at any source resolution. widths = the planned AVIF/WebP ladder (rungs wider than the crop are dropped, never upscaled; the script adds one top rung of up to twice max_css_width when the crop has the pixels). target_min_width = the original requirement for the crop width (2400 px hero / full-width desktop, 1200 px elsewhere). max_css_width = the widest the slot renders in the built site (320–1920 px viewports, measured 2026-10-16); the crop should be at least twice that for 2x screens. desktop_min_width: the d crop serves viewports at or above it, the m crop below. reused_on lists the other pages that show the same files.",
